  contentsAnswer: Only some clothes and personal things.
  weightAnswer: All right, there are exercise weights under the clothes. Roughly
    sixteen kilos total.
  metalAnswer: The weights are cast metal. I did not want to explain my training
    equipment.
  packingAnswer: One weight is loose at the bottom. It slides downhill, then stays
    there.
  responseAnswer: A heavy short thud, perhaps some metal rattle. Nothing can push
    back uphill.
  authorReasoning: Deliberately misleading innocent. Follow-ups predict high mass/metal
    and passive irreversible sliding. False accusation remains possible.
